        <item>
            <title>2.5.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 11:37:20 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/appnoe/homebrew-bromehew</link>
            <sparkle:version>16</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li>Notifications for Bromehew's activity, each kind with its own switch in Settings › General › Notifications: new updates found in the background (once per version), what automatic updates installed or left for you, and problems: Homebrew that cannot be checked or updated, and services that start failing. A click opens the matching section. They come from the menu bar app, so they also arrive when the main window is closed.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/appnoe/homebrew-bromehew/releases/download/v2.5.0/Bromehew-2.5.0.dmg" length="4646126" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="EFntIQ6QTyUJVUC54fbSlo8I9H1Gkgu6F7ZgZ0gT4pcwaq4hwQh9HJMEliapPJ5odKgUUkw7Tbf/0IvJWzObDA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>2.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 11:21:12 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/appnoe/homebrew-bromehew</link>
            <sparkle:version>15</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li>Automatic updates: Bromehew can install Homebrew updates once a day in the background (Settings › General). The menu bar app runs them; pinned packages, apps that update themselves and apps that are open are left alone, no password is ever asked for, and a notification reports anything that needs you. The log is in <code>~/Library/Logs/Bromehew</code>. After updating, Bromehew asks once whether to turn them on; they are off until then.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/appnoe/homebrew-bromehew/releases/download/v2.4.0/Bromehew-2.4.0.dmg" length="4634180" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="TNjIpU5n3GCA9UzRVRkzxoTmb0Op7fmn31pHPAZZ4iPq6INoBnXKcbiELArSejsL1W6120qcDDK6UNAYp3h0Cg=="/>
